WEBVTT

NOTE
Audio Description for the FF8 New Game Intro FMV (disc00_30h.avi).
This FMV plays after the player selects "New Game" from the title screen.
It features the ocean, Rinoa in a flower field, and the iconic Squall vs Seifer duel.
Music: "Liberi Fatali" (orchestral choir piece).
Estimated duration: ~3:12.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Fade in from black.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Waves roll rhythmically onto a smooth, pale sandy beach. The camera slowly pans across the shoreline as surf washes forward and recedes.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:27.000
The ocean stretches to the horizon, sunlight glinting off the water's surface. The waves continue their steady pulse against the sand.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:33.800
White text appears over the ocean, the words floating ethereally: "I'll be here..."

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:37.800
Camera races across the water. Text: "Why?"

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:42.000
The ocean transforms into a vast cracked desert.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.400
The camera sweeps across the desert. Text: "I'll be waiting... here..."

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:52.400
Rinoa stands in a field of flowers, facing away. Text: "For what?"

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:55.500
Closer on Rinoa, hair blowing. Text: "I'll be here... Why...?"

00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:01.600
Close-up of Rinoa's hand; she opens her palm and a soft glow appears.

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:08.600
A glowing white feather appears in her palm and drifts upward.

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:20.000
The feather rises into dark, swirling storm clouds. Pink petals spiral around it as it ascends into an increasingly turbulent sky.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:28.000
The feather reaches its apex and transforms — a gunblade falls from the storm and slams point-first into stone.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Title card: "SQUARESOFT presents."

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:36.600
A gloved hand reaches down and grips the embedded gunblade.

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:42.000
Rapid montage: white feathers flood the screen amid flashes of characters.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:46.000
Rapid cuts: a woman's silhouette, flowing fabric, intense eyes.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:51.600
Edea in her horned headdress and dark robes. Rinoa turns amid feathers.

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:59.000
The feathers dissolve. Scene shifts to a barren rocky plateau under grey clouds.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:04.800
Seifer, blond in a grey trench coat, swings his gunblade Hyperion and smirks.

00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:10.400
Seifer raises a hand, beckoning his opponent forward with a cocky smirk.

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:15.000
Squall, in a fur-collared black jacket, charges from the opposite end.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:18.000
Blades clash in an explosion of sparks.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:22.200
Rapid cuts: Edea's eyes, Rinoa watching, then back to the duel.

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:26.600
Gunblades locked together; both fighters strain against each other.

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:30.000
Seifer pushes Squall back. Squall counter-attacks.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:34.600
They exchange a flurry of strikes, circling the rocky ground.

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:39.800
Seifer casts a fire spell; a burst of flame blasts Squall back.

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:46.000
Squall is knocked to the ground. He forces himself to rise.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:52.000
Seifer slashes the rising Squall across the face; blood streaks down his cheek. Cut to Rinoa's pendant, Edea's eyes.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:56.600
Golden overlays: Rinoa and Edea's images merge and separate.

00:02:56.600 --> 00:02:59.600
Squall charges Seifer with a desperate upward slash.

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:03.000
The slash cuts Seifer's face. Both men now bear matching scars.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.400
Squall and Rinoa reach for each other. Cut to black.

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:12.000
The Final Fantasy 8 logo: Squall and Rinoa embracing, framed by wings. Final Fantasy 8 Accessibility Mod, by Aaron Page.
